title Figure 2. Use Case Diagram of LOCUS-SF

actor "Guest" as Guest
actor "Investor" as Investor
actor "Broker" as Broker
actor "CAO / ASSESSOR or\nLEBDO staff" as Office
actor "CICTO\nadministrator" as CICTO

rectangle "LOCUS-SF" {
  usecase "Find and evaluate\nproperties" as U01
  usecase "Compare properties" as U02
  usecase "Save properties" as U03
  usecase "Apply or reapply\nas broker" as U04
  usecase "Submit or edit\nown listings" as U06
  usecase "Assess and manage\nproperties" as U10
  usecase "Review broker\napplications" as U16
  usecase "Manage city accounts\nand reviewer permissions" as U17

  U01 -[hidden]down- U02
  U02 -[hidden]down- U03
  U03 -[hidden]down- U04
  U04 -[hidden]down- U06
  U06 -[hidden]down- U10
  U10 -[hidden]down- U16
  U16 -[hidden]down- U17
}

Guest -right- U01
Guest -right- U02
Guest -right- U04
Investor -right- U01
Investor -right- U02
Investor -right- U03
Broker -right- U04
Broker -right- U06
U10 -right- Office
U16 -right- Office
U10 -right- CICTO
U17 -right- CICTO

legend bottom
  Main goals; authenticated access and role-specific prerequisites apply.
  Guest access is a limited public preview. Broker review requires explicit authorization.
  Discovery includes search/filter, maps, details, preliminary assessments and nearby business context.
endlegend
